@@ -12,6 +12,12 @@ See the [Contributing Guide](contributing.md) for details.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and listed in the order of their first reference
+  rather than the order of their definitions. Set the new `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER`
+  option of the footnotes extension to `True` to restore the old behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
